---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — Sutura Solutions"
  description="How Sutura Solutions collects, uses, and protects personal information, including cross-border processing through AI service providers."
>

  <!-- NAV -->
  <nav class="nav">
    <div class="nav-inner">
      <a href="/" class="nav-logo">
        <svg class="nav-logo-mark" viewBox="0 0 340 64" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Sutura Solutions">
          <path d="M32,12 L52,32 L32,52 L12,32 Z" fill="none" stroke="#c1502e" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-dasharray="7 6"/>
          <circle cx="32" cy="12" r="6" fill="#2b2420"/>
          <circle cx="52" cy="32" r="6" fill="#2b2420"/>
          <circle cx="32" cy="52" r="6" fill="#2b2420"/>
          <circle cx="12" cy="32" r="6" fill="#2b2420"/>
          <circle cx="32" cy="12" r="2.2" fill="#faf6f0"/>
          <circle cx="52" cy="32" r="2.2" fill="#faf6f0"/>
          <circle cx="32" cy="52" r="2.2" fill="#faf6f0"/>
          <circle cx="12" cy="32" r="2.2" fill="#faf6f0"/>
          <text x="76" y="30" font-family="Fraunces, Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif" font-size="24" font-weight="700" fill="#2b2420">Sutura</text>
          <text x="76" y="50" font-family="Fraunces, Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif" font-size="15" fill="#5b5147" letter-spacing="1.5">SOLUTIONS</text>
        </svg>
      </a>
      <ul class="nav-links" id="nav-links">
        <li><a href="/#who-we-help">Who We Help</a></li>
        <li><a href="/#what-we-do">What We Do</a></li>
        <li><a href="/#how-it-works">How It Works</a></li>
        <li><a href="/about">About</a></li>
        <li><a href="mailto:info@suturasolutions.com" class="nav-cta">Get In Touch</a></li>
      </ul>
      <button class="nav-toggle" id="nav-toggle" aria-label="Toggle menu">
        <span></span>
        <span></span>
        <span></span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- PRIVACY POLICY -->
  <section class="legal" id="privacy-policy">
    <div class="container legal-content">
      <span class="section-label">Privacy Policy</span>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: 15 July 2026</p>

      <p>
        Sutura Solutions ("we", "us", "our") is committed to handling personal information in
        accordance with the <a href="https://www.oaic.gov.au/privacy/australian-privacy-principles" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australian Privacy Principles (APPs)</a> under the
        <a href="https://www.legislation.gov.au/C2004A03712/latest" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Privacy Act 1988 (Cth)</a>.
        This policy explains what we collect, how we use it, and your rights.
      </p>

      <h2>What We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        We only collect personal information that's reasonably necessary for our services. This
        typically includes:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Contact details you provide (name, email, phone) when booking a discovery call or getting in touch</li>
        <li>Business information shared during discovery calls, audits, and project engagements</li>
        <li>Operational data involved in the systems we build or connect to as part of an engagement</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How We Use It</h2>
      <p>
        We use your information only for the purpose it was collected: to respond to enquiries,
        scope and deliver engagements, and provide ongoing support. We do not sell or on-sell
        personal information to third parties.
      </p>

      <h2>Cross-Border Disclosure &amp; AI Processing</h2>
      <p>
        Some of the automations and systems we build process data through AI service providers
        based overseas (including Anthropic, OpenAI, and Google). Where this involves personal
        information, we use enterprise-tier accounts with these providers, which carry data
        handling terms designed to meet our obligations under
        <a href="https://www.oaic.gov.au/privacy/australian-privacy-principles/australian-privacy-principles-guidelines/chapter-8-app-8-cross-border-disclosure-of-personal-information" target="_blank" rel="noopener">APP 8</a>. We document data flows for
        each engagement and will discuss this with you directly before any client data is
        processed through a third-party AI service.
      </p>

      <h2>Data Security</h2>
      <p>
        We take reasonable steps to protect personal information from misuse, interference, loss,
        and unauthorised access, consistent with
        <a href="https://www.oaic.gov.au/privacy/australian-privacy-principles/australian-privacy-principles-guidelines/chapter-11-app-11-security-of-personal-information" target="_blank" rel="noopener">APP 11</a>. Systems we build and operate run on
        infrastructure we manage directly, so we can monitor for and respond to issues.
      </p>

      <h2>Data Breaches</h2>
      <p>
        In the event of a data breach likely to result in serious harm, we will notify the
        <a href="https://www.oaic.gov.au/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Office of the Australian Information Commissioner (OAIC)</a> and affected individuals in accordance
        with the <a href="https://www.oaic.gov.au/privacy/notifiable-data-breaches/about-the-notifiable-data-breaches-scheme" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Notifiable Data Breaches (NDB) scheme</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Your Rights</h2>
      <p>
        You can ask us what personal information we hold about you, request a correction, or ask
        us to delete it, subject to any legal obligations we have to retain it. Contact us using
        the details below.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        For any privacy-related questions or requests, email us at
        <a href="mailto:info@suturasolutions.com">info@suturasolutions.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FOOTER -->
  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="footer-inner">
        <span class="footer-logo">Sutura Solutions</span>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Sutura Solutions. Perth, Western Australia.</p>
        <a href="/privacy-policy" class="footer-link">Privacy Policy</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

</Layout>

<script>
  const toggle = document.getElementById('nav-toggle');
  const links = document.getElementById('nav-links');

  toggle?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    links?.classList.toggle('open');
  });

  document.querySelectorAll('.nav-links a').forEach(link => {
    link.addEventListener('click', () => {
      links?.classList.remove('open');
    });
  });
</script>
